      {
        "author_name": "C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116850886016431928204/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-7GAR8eAtkhJX9dh2oyi591OBbtvu_15SiFCBhSk7UZU1KQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Clarisse is amazing. She is the kindest person and makes you feel so comfortable. I've been seeing her since she started and from the first tattoo she did as an apprentice, to the ones she does now, I love them all. Her studio also has an amazing vibe, I always love going back :)",
        "time": 1682379896,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cathy Diemahave",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112525276435147157786/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVxZmPhcdxMgmKzhzMdwuS8gYOPAMxdBuuxd6w80jKGXtfJA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Clarisse did a beautiful floral tattoo on my arm. I’m incredibly happy with it. She’s the cleanest tattoo artist I’ve ever seen. This is my 6th tattoo and I’m definitely getting more from her. She is a beautiful person, professional and was very patient with me. She can do any style and I love that. I’m never seeing another tattoo artist other than her. She’s amazing truly!",
        "time": 1689967958,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gabrielle Killeen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103708390495493265373/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKnxlaPfCZJRkin7_JAvN2TlwBfgIrsFCsmNE2yLweKaKGC0g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Clarisse is amazing! She worked really hard to get the details right and the tattoos turned out better than I could have imagined! 10/10",
        "time": 1692027720,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jean-Christophe Desire",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117880694575883079344/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU88VSdMNzZZNtVFwR3z4gbM-Usll3FGIOvmeilraXrrNknFR_N=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I love my tattoos and im very picky on how they look! She did a personalized sketch of what i wanted and she came up with exactly what i wanted!! Her lines are clean and all the details are there!!",
        "time": 1682293587,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Nathalie Bourassa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103852526354692075544/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL2z_uDLw8imzbVtwCtKFYdvRMhtYzORt0x6moLgEaP7ZKQPw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "What a wonderful first experience it was for me. Clarisse is exceptional, she listens, is patient and what can I say about her talent? Wow. She did exactly what I wanted and more. She welcomed us in a calm and relaxed atmosphere, she is gentle and caring. I highly recommend her.",
